# Example secret contract for the identity-service deployment (SPEC-008 R-3/R-7).
# Copy to runtime-secrets.env (never committed) and replace the placeholders, or
# let CI inject the real values. Sync into the cluster as the optional Secret
# 'identity-service-runtime-secrets' referenced by the identity-service
# deployment (which also carries OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET for confidential clients).
#
# IDENTITY_SERVICE_CLIENTS registers the service callers permitted to request
# delegated tokens. Format: comma-separated entries of
#   client_id:client_secret:audience1|audience2
# The platform-gateway's PLATFORM_GATEWAY_SERVICE_CLIENT_SECRET must match the
# secret registered here for client_id 'platform-gateway' (SPEC-010).
IDENTITY_SERVICE_CLIENTS=platform-gateway:replace-with-platform-gateway-service-client-secret:tool-gateway

# Durable audit trail ingest credential (SPEC-013 R-3). Must match the secret
# registered for client id 'identity-broker' in the audit-service's
# AUDIT_INGEST_CLIENTS registry (see sync-audit-secrets.sh).
IDENTITY_AUDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=replace-with-shared-audit-ingest-secret
